State 0

    0 $accept: • PROGRAMME_RULE $end

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE)

    PROGRAMME_RULE        go to state 1
    MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE  go to state 2


State 1

    0 $accept: PROGRAMME_RULE • $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 3


State 2

    1 PROGRAMME_RULE: MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE • DECLARATION_STATEMENT_LIST_RULE FUNCTION_LIST_RULE LOGIC_BLOCK
    3 MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE: MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE • PACKAGE_DECLARATION
    4                     | MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE • MODULE_DECLARATION
    5                     | MODULE_PREAMBLE_RULE • IMPORT_DECLARATION

    INT      shift, and go to state 4
    FLOAT    shift, and go to state 5
    STRING   shift, and go to state 6
    VOID     shift, and go to state 7
    BOOL     shift, and go to state 8
    DOUBLE   shift, and go to state 9
    PACKAGE  shift, and go to state 10
    MODULE   shift, and go to state 11
    IMPORT   shift, and go to state 12

    PACKAGE_DECLARATION              go to state 13
    MODULE_DECLARATION               go to state 14
    IMPORT_DECLARATION               go to state 15
    DECLARATION_STATEMENT_LIST_RULE  go to state 16
    ShortType                        go to state 17
    DECLARATION_STATEMENT_RULE       go to state 18


State 3

    0 $accept: PROGRAMME_RULE $end •

    $default  accept


State 4

   20 ShortType: INT •

